LOCATION:ABC (SALLE A)\, 13 rue Saint-Bernard\, 31000 Toulouse
DTSTART:20260912T141500Z
SUMMARY:Fjord (VOST)
UID:95d58339-7efc-4de6-8ec9-221503d6e4be@95d5.org
END:VEVENT
